{"version":1,"content":"<p>開發者PLK近日展示了《俠盜獵車手5》經實驗性原生重編譯後在Switch 2上運行的畫面，並已修復着色器故障。該項目藉助kaiHEN自製軟件環境在改裝主機上執行原生應用，並非Rockstar或任天堂推出的官方移植。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586766.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:10:00.192496+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_hash":"01281555ce74854d7157ecf4ed3e072a5574d484365d433a7f8e17172e41cc0c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}